// {"files":[{"path":"\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\danie\\OneDrive\\github-repos\\stranded-horizons\\docs\\refactor-2.5d.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":19,"lines":["+# Refactor 2.5D notes (issue #8)","+","+## Renderer swap","+`src/main.js` picks the renderer from `?renderer=`:","+- default / `?renderer=2d` → `src/rendering/Renderer2D.js` (pixel-faithful)","+- `?renderer=25d` → `src/rendering/Renderer25D.js` (shadows, depth sort, billboard anchors, camera follow + wheel zoom, optional `camera.mode = 'iso'`)","+","+A future `Renderer3D` only needs `render(state, assets, camera)`. Simulation never","+touches DOM/canvas; all world→screen mapping goes through `src/rendering/Camera.js`.","+","+## Adding content without touching systems","+- Weapon: add entry to `src/data/weapons.js`.","+- Enemy: add entry to `src/data/enemies.js` (+ sprite in `src/rendering/Assets.js` image map).","+- Upgrade: add def to `src/data/upgrades.js`; purchase logic is data-driven in `src/simulation/ProgressionSystem.js`.","+","+## Simulation rules","+- Time: `state.timeMs` (ms, advanced by `dt`). Never call `performance.now()` in sim.","+- Randomness: use injected `ctx.rng`. Never call `Math.random()` in sim.","+- Update order per frame: reload → movement → shoot → wave → enemies → projectiles → pickups → buffs → particles → collisions → derived stats."]}]}]}
